OL,3,AOne of the five men arrested near RAF
OL,4,AFairford called 999 himself
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of five men arrested near RAF
OL,7,FFairford in the early hours of Sunday
OL,8,Fmorning had dialled 999 himself, the
OL,9,FBBC understands.
OL,11,FThe suspect called the police at 00:45
OL,12,FBST, almost an hour before a farmer
OL,13,Falso dialled 999 after seeing men in
OL,14,Fbalaclavas.
OL,16,FThe five were arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fexplosives offences and later terrorism
OL,18,Foffences after three vans were spotted,
OL,19,Fsparking a major security incident
OL,20,Faround the Gloucestershire base which
OL,21,Fthe US military operates.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
